>**Increase Nation's Reconnaissance.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Gain your mission from {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* Head to any Northern area not controlled by the Allied forces (only {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} and {z:Xarcabard (S)} work for this op) and make your way to the Stronghold.
* Examine the {p:???} at the Stronghold to gather the Intel.
** Note: There are two {p:???} around the Stronghold.
* Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

=3 Notes
* You can not collect Intel while under the effect of Sneak/Invis.
* While gathering Intel you will not get aggro.

:* If you have tags on, you can get aggro from campaign mobs and be interrupted. You can still try to collect intel again later.

* While gathering Intel {p:Blockaid|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Command/blockaid} is activated. At completion, Blockaid is turned off. It takes approximately 2 minutes to gather intel.
* You will receive EXP whether or not you have Allied Tags. In fact, you can complete this mission whether or not a Campaign battle is going on or not.
* You cannot perform this mission if all outdoor areas in the Northern Front are being controlled by the alliance.

=2 Objective
Current intel on the defensive capabilities of enemy's northern strongholds has been deemed insufficient. You are to infiltrate one of these strongholds and gather as much data as possible.
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
